      "dataStream": "Research Canvas\rOne question per canvas. Looking for counter-evidence as hard as you look for confirmation is what separates research from justification.\rQuestion\r\rSources\rWhere you looked, with links. A source without a link becomes a vague memory in a month.\rEvidence\r\rCounter-arguments\rWhat weakens your conclusion. If this section is empty, the research is not finished.\rConclusion\r\rConfidence in the conclusion\r\r\n",
